  "note": "New package entry ./wallet/devnet-delivery-transport (src/wallet/devnet-delivery-transport.mjs) exports only createDevnetDeliveryTransport({admission, ...transportOptions}). It checks the admission shape with readAdmission before anything is built, constructs the existing internal Deliverable publication transport (devnet-native-transport.mjs, unchanged) and returns only its held facade from createHeldTransportFacade, so active members reject profile_not_admitted while held and the facade passes isDevnetSettlementTransport. The README describes the entry; the gate's pinned manifest, HOLD.json, the release policy's manifest pin and requiredExports, the exact-export tests and the entry closure name it. No other source file changes."
